WEBVTT

NOTE
Deling City Parade — Sorceress Edea on her float and President Deling's speech.
Duration: approximately 59 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Close-up of Edea's ornate spiral headdress from behind — she's in a dark backstage area of the float.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Edea's parade float moves through the Deling City streets.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Crowds line the parade route; the float passes under the lit archway.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The float's interior — curtains part to reveal Edea's dark throne room within.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Inside the float: Edea seated on a gold-trimmed throne, framed by white drapes.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The float glides into the ceremonial plaza under dark cloudy skies.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The parade reaches the central plaza. Galbadian crowds watch from all sides.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Close-up of Edea's face in profile — cold and regal in her full sorceress regalia.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Edea surveys the crowd, her golden headdress catching the light.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
President Deling takes his position at the outdoor podium before the arch.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Deling addresses the crowd from the podium. Parade floats flank him on both sides.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Wide shot: President Deling at the podium, Deling City arch glowing behind him, Edea's floats flanking the scene.
